msgstr "digiKam是專為攝影師瀏覽、管理、編輯、加工、整理、標記及分享照片等用途而設計。"

msgid "To export your photos from digiKam to Piwigo, simply install digiKam and the Kipi-plugins."
msgstr "從digiKam要匯出相片到Piwigo，只需安裝digiKam和Kipi-plugins插件。"

